WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:05.300
<i>The Black Army is a force of darkness
that showed up without warning.</i>

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.530
<i>Led by the Black King,
it seeks to destroy the world.</i>

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:18.730
You're Yuri of the Volunteer Army.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.910
And you are?

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:34.960
I'm Aram.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:45.590
Aram!

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:47.010
Is he dead?

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.050
No way.

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:50.750
Marina, healing magic!

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:51.480
Right away.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.410
It's all right.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:56.720
He's just unconscious.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.720
Man, don't scare me like that.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.850
Who is this kid?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:03:00.530
<b>To Be With Others</b>

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:10.300
So, they're headed for the Vice Capital.

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:27.030
Where am I?

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.360
You're awake.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.190
What happened to the old lady and the rest?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.440
They're all safe.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.270
That's a relief.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:40.000
The villagers said to thank you.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.370
It was nothing.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.070
You're Yuri, aren't you?

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:47.590
You've heard of me?

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.890
I heard you're the captain 
of the Volunteer Army.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.010
Oh, you're awake?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.140
Thank goodness you're okay.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:08.110
Oh, I'm Phoena.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.360
Nice to meet you.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.230
Sure.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:13.530
Let's go eat.

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:17.500
Kain and the others
will be back from patrol soon.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:18.580
Yeah.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:21.830
Here you go.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:22.620
Thanks.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.250
Here.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:23.920
Yeah.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.090
Here.

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:28.930
Thanks.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.550
Time to eat.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.760
What is it, Kain?

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.260
Ah... Is this...

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.590
Don't tell me...

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.340
Phoena's cooking, isn't she?

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.480
Eat up, everyone.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:54.700
Seconds, please.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:57.450
Coming right up.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:01.240
How can you eat Phoena's cooking?

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.540
What do you mean? It's great.

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.960
What do you usually eat?

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:07.960
Lizards.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:11.050
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:11.880
Here you are.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.800
There's plenty more where that came from.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.640
S-Sure.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:22.430
Aram, you aren't from 
that village, are you?

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.390
No, I was just passing by.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:28.380
You were trying to protect the village
all by yourself?

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:30.610
I couldn't just let it be destroyed.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:33.400
Besides, I can't stand those black things.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.990
You're pretty strong.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.410
Y-Yeah.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:38.820
But...

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:41.420
But I'm not good enough.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:44.560
I want to get a lot stronger.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.410
Phoena! The Chronicle!

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:02.800
Your Highness!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.020
Phoena!

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:08.560
What's happening?

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:14.190
Look out!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.530
Aram!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.110
Are you all right?

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:19.740
Yeah.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.180
Phoena.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.300
Phoena!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.800
Thank you.

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.350
Looks like it's settled down.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:55.270
Hey, what is that?

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:58.040
The Chain Chronicle.

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:01.910
A chronology of everything about the world.

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:06.890
If the world is stained black, 
so will the Chronicle.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.290
And vice versa.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.000
That can't be...

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:16.920
More pages have been stained black.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:26.060
The darkness spreads further.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:32.190
Have you still not located the sprite?

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:36.820
Was it not killed in the last battle?

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.950
The world has yet to fall into ruin.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:42.950
Then...

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:43.900
Yeah.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.030
Pirika is still alive somewhere.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:46.910
Pirika?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.580
One of our friends. A sprite.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:51.570
Tiny and cute.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:56.030
Pirika has a foul mouth at times,
but is very important to this world.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:08:00.070
Pirika is the will of the world,
a world with hope for the future.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:04.720
We have to find and save it.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.220
Find her and dispose of it.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:16.320
So long as that sprite exists, 
the world cannot be destroyed.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:28.890
What's up?

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.700
Can we talk?

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:35.290
Aram, why do you want to become stronger?

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:36.880
Why?

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.510
Because you can't do anything 
if you're weak, obviously.

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.220
I see.

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:48.390
Aram, why don't you join us?

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:55.150
No, I'm not gonna join the Volunteer Army.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.280
I'd rather be my own man. Free.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:00.150
There's only so much you can do by yourself.

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:01.780
That's not true.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:04.510
I've fought alone my entire life.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:07.280
But it's not as if you've never lost, is it?

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:11.230
There must have been times
when you had to run from your opponent.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.850
Well...

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:15.190
I'll be able to beat them someday.

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:17.880
What if you were just lucky?

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.630
What would you know?

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:23.930
You lost even with your buddies.

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.430
That's exactly why I'm asking.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:29.390
Aram, hear me out...

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:42.550
The highway ahead seems to have
escaped the blackening earlier.

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:43.650
Thank goodness.

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.360
We'll depart at dawn.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:47.360
For the Vice Capital.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.710
That's...

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:01.170
Hurry!

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:17.690
Don't let a single one of them through!

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.820
This is too easy.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.920
I stock only the best weapons.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.030
Dammit.

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:16.580
Yuri!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:17.910
Yuri!

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:19.540
It's good to see you.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:20.500
You, too, Princess.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.080
Sorry to worry you.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.380
Status?

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.960
The southern bridge has fallen.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.550
The outer wall is, well,
you can see for yourself.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:31.010
Aludra's defending the castle walls
by the slums, but...

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.360
New recruit? Kid's got spirit.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:49.320
Yes.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.330
We'll handle things here.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:04.330
Got it. I'm counting on you.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:07.670
All right! We're going to go help Aludra out!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.390
There are so many of them.

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:17.430
What do we do, Captain?

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:18.720
What else?

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:19.770
We take 'em down!

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:20.380
You got it!

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:22.480
Let's finish this!

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.260
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:28.600
Don't forget me!

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:36.030
More of them?

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.380
Piece of cake.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.050
You...

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:56.810
You took my mana again!

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.470
Wh-What?

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:02.920
Burckhardt!

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:05.850
We'll discuss this later.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:06.520
Ow...

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:09.400
Man, what's his problem?

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:10.480
Let's do this!

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:41.800
Seize the light!

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:55.330
W-Wow.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.820
We did it.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:13:59.770
Yeah.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:00.910
Hey!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.330
That was amazing!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.700
I-I guess.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.330
That was our chain attack.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.820
Chaining attacks makes them more powerful.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.550
And to do that,
we need all our mana to resonate.

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.090
I want to try.

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.140
I think it might be a bit soon for you.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.340
Why?

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:20.800
I can practice.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:24.670
Aram, it isn't that easy.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:28.520
You need strong bonds
with your allies to pull it off.

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.640
Bonds?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.360
You're wasting your time.

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:33.230
What?!

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.530
You understand nothing of battle.

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:40.460
You just fight mindlessly,
thinking of no-one but yourself.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.360
What? I have my own way of fighting—

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.260
And I'm telling you it's all wrong.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.790
What exactly are you, anyway?

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:51.380
I don't know how you did it, 
but you stole my mana.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.290
S-So what?

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.290
Humans shouldn't be capable of 
meddling with others' mana.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.300
There's too much about you we don't know.

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.390
Shut up!

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.300
You're just jealous that you can't do it!

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:04.600
This is getting nowhere.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:08.310
It's clearly a waste of time trying to
explain things to a feral brat like you.

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:11.940
I'm not here because I want to be!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:13.980
If you don't want me around, I'll just leave.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:16.440
I'll become stronger my own way!

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.230
Aram!

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:19.030
Let him go.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:23.110
Don't be so undisciplined as to 
allow that fool to have his way.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:26.540
Why do you not realize that
being so soft only makes you weak?

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:29.290
Aram has potential.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.590
Do you honestly believe that?

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:35.670
That's why I brought him all the way here.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.220
He'll make a good soldier.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:47.430
Looks like the boss has appeared.

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:56.430
Dammit.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.120
Not this fog again!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.070
Let's go again.

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.330
The fog just gets thicker.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.610
I can't...

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.860
Captain!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.120
D-Don't worry. I'm fine.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:16.370
Protect Her Highness!

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:27.090
<i>Aram, hear me out.</i>

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:31.600
When I lost to the Black King,
I also lost faith in myself.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:36.070
But seeing you fight
so desperately in that village

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:39.490
reminded me of something important.

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:45.610
I had sworn I would never give up,
no matter what.

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:49.750
Wh-What's any of this got to do with me?

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:53.960
When I came to, my friends were at my side.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.460
They'd supported me. 
They never gave up on me.

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:02.840
Some obstacles can't be overcome alone.
They require a little help from your friends.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:05.430
That is the power of bonds.

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:08.890
Aram, you are indeed strong.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:12.350
You're better at using mana than anyone else.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:20.660
But, with bonds of friendship,
you can become even stronger.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.450
Let us fight together.

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:31.990
You idiot.

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.800
We can't hold out any longer.

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.170
We have to!

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:42.210
Wayne!

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:43.980
Stay back, Your Highness.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:45.920
I can fight.

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:50.060
Your Highness!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.030
Your Highness...

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:05.860
Burckhardt!

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:18.660
Aram!

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:38.220
Y-You've gotta be kidding me.

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.770
Amazing.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.770
Hey, take this!

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.200
We're even now.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.290
Burckhardt!

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.760
Let's end this.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.800
As you wish!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.350
Know your place!

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:52.160
Whoa. He's pretty good.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:55.690
Look at you. Coming back to steal the show.

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:56.640
Aram.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:03.940
I figured I might as well
stick around a bit longer.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:07.220
I want to see more of
your techniques in action.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.020
Besides...

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:12.540
I want to make him eat his words.

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:17.030
That's fine.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:26.640
Everyone, there's something I need to say.

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:30.670
I lost to the Black King once.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:36.410
He said that destruction is
the fate that awaits this world.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:41.170
But, even if that's true, 
I don't want to give up.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.300
As long as we live, there's hope.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:51.480
So I'd like to form
a Black King Suppression Squad,

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:54.210
once more.

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.920
A Black King Suppression Squad?

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:57.840
That won't be enough.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:00.140
We'll gather troops from
every corner of the land

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.950
and form a Black King Suppression <i>Army</i>.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.490
Yuri's back to his old self.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.930
That's my captain.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:10.850
Someone thinks pretty highly of himself.

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:14.770
Yuri, I'm so glad.

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:18.420
Aram.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:23.780
All right, fine.

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:31.190
Aram, your arm.

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:45.970
You should give him a chance.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.830
He returned your mana, after all.

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.410
Excuse me.

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:54.290
Sheesh.

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.580
Burckhardt!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:11.050
Burckhardt!

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Symbol of Loyalty</b>

00:23:46.180 --> 00:23:48.990
Fate is set in motion.
